{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Master the art of stealth in Super Silent Sensei, a fast-paced, casual stealth game where precision and cunning are key. Step into the role of a legendary ninja on a mission to rescue elusive aliens scattered across the military compound Zone 52 without ever being captured.</i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>Stay hidden, stay silent, and use your environment to outsmart patrolling enemies and traps, you only have one\u00a0</i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><u><strong><i>Get all aliens and make a run for the escape point!</i></strong></u><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>Only the most disciplined Sensei will succeed.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381650/extras/ss3.gif?t=1743859494\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381650/extras/ss1.gif?t=1743859494\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381650/extras/ss2.gif?t=1743859494\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong> </strong></i><br><i><strong>Do you have the patience, skill, and precision to remain unseen? Step into the shadows and prove yourself as the Super Silent Sensei.  </strong></i><br><i><strong>  </strong></i><br><i><strong>  </strong></i><br><i><strong>THANK YOU FOR YOUR SUPPORT!</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381650/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1743859494\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3381650/7698b4a330cdf5944bad5c4c7a38b2306858101d.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images